algorithms.pseudocode:
function TropicalJones(D, n):
    if D is loop:
        return 0 if n = 0, else infinity
    else D = crossing(D0, D1):
        return min(TropicalJones(D0, n-1), TropicalJones(D1, n+1))

Time: O(2^c), Space: O(c)

function TropicalJonesDP(D):
    if D is loop: return {0: 0}
    left = TropicalJonesDP(D.left).shift(+1)
    right = TropicalJonesDP(D.right).shift(-1)
    return tropAdd(left, right)

Time: O(c^2), Space: O(c)
